    "signature": "fn base_type(data_type: &arrow::datatypes::DataType) -> arrow::datatypes::DataType",
    "docs": "Get the base type of a data type.\n\nExample\n```\nuse arrow::datatypes::{DataType, Field};\nuse datafusion_common::utils::base_type;\nuse std::sync::Arc;\n\nlet data_type =\n    DataType::List(Arc::new(Field::new_list_field(DataType::Int32, true)));\nassert_eq!(base_type(&data_type), DataType::Int32);\n\nlet data_type = DataType::Int32;\nassert_eq!(base_type(&data_type), DataType::Int32);\n```",
